    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manage a link between an <computeroutput>IMP</computeroutput> object and a part of the RMF file. This allows conformations to be saved flexibly.</para>
<para><ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1rmf_1aa8acef5aeb23091606a8cc774387c8f6" kindref="member">SaveLinks</ref> must not save any handles to RMF objects.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Warning: SaveLink has not been stabilized and is likely to change without notice.</title><para></para>
</simplesect>
</para>
